<title>PHILIPPINES: ALI to infuse more capital,to issue debt.</title>
<headline>ALI to infuse more capital,to issue debt.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ayala Land Inc said on Wednesday its board had approved the sale of 4.0 billion to 6.0 billion pesos worth of long-term commercial paper.</p>
<p>The proposed debt issue had earlier been registered with the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>Ayala said in a statement the board had also approved an additional equity infusion of 140 million pesos in Pilipinas Makro, a wholesale trading company, to bring its total investments to 310.24 million pesos.</p>
</text>
